<title>USA: New Age Media Fund sets dividend of $3.09.</title>
<headline>New Age Media Fund sets dividend of $3.09.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Age Media Fund Inc, a closed-end investment company, said Wednesday it declared a per-share dividend of $3.09.</p>
<p>The company said in a release that the dividend is payable on December 30 to stockholders of record on December 20, 1996.</p>
<p>It added that of the $3.09 amount, $1.59 reflected short-term capital gains and $1.50 long-term capital gains.</p>
</text>
